le":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/foE2x4gKINHYtUCRwLZ5bPZyxWp.jpg"},{"id":945973,"name":"Daichi Harashima","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v2t7UaEVHnDseceqXugob9Pvr1g.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'imperatrice e i guerrieri","overview":"Nell'antica Cina, l'imperatore viene ucciso in battaglia e gli succede sua figlia Yen, che dovrà difendere il suo regno. Ma suo cugino Wu Ba, ambizioso e senza scrupoli, tenta di ucciderla."},{"language":"en-US","title":"An Empress and the Warriors","overview":"After the death of her father, a woman is forced to take over as empress and fight to save her kingdom."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"燕赵大战，燕王受重伤，大将慕容雪虎（甄子丹 饰）临危受命。燕帅（郭晓冬 饰）因妒生恨，弑君谋位。大王惨死，举国悲恸，根据大王遗愿，欲传皇位于慕容将军，而燕帅多有阻挠。情急之下，大王之位只能传于手持大燕传国之宝——飞燕刃的公主燕飞儿（陈慧琳 饰），慕容将军尽忠职守，全力训练燕飞儿。不料公主离奇失踪，飞虎将军难辞其咎。燕飞儿被燕帅派出的杀手追杀并身中毒箭，幸被隐士段兰泉（黎明 饰）所救，一时难以回营。此时燕帅排除异己，欲自立为王。燕飞儿不久后回营却正值赵兵进犯之时，而燕帅为求王印，按兵不动。前有劲敌压境，后有逆臣虎视眈眈，公主带领众将生擒赵王父子，却放他们返回赵国。燕帅称王不成反受到惩罚，燕飞儿登基在即却放弃王位，传位于慕容雪虎后返回山林找段兰泉过起神仙眷侣般的生活。燕帅并没有善罢甘休，又一场血雨腥风的笼罩在风雨飘摇的大燕国上空…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x3CxPJUmK9erh7qBz0vuTMnt9kh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtLwzKN078LcCQKDVah10BbI1Ue.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":14539,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x3CxPJUmK9erh7qBz0vuTMnt9kh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x3CxPJUmK9erh7qBz0vuTMnt9kh.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x3CxPJUmK9erh7qBz0vuTMnt9kh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x3CxPJUmK9erh7qBz0vuTMnt9kh.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"available","s